language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario InspectMachine.
condition InspectMachineReady.
condition InspectMachineContinue.
condition InspectMachineReject.
outcome InspectMachineCompleted.
outcome InspectMachineRejected.
step InspectMachineReceive.
step InspectMachineDecode.
step InspectMachineCalibrate.
step InspectMachineReduce.
step InspectMachinePublish.
step InspectMachineAdapt.
step InspectMachineProject.
step InspectMachineFailure.
step InspectMachineSuccess.

InspectMachine illustrates LiveMachineInspection.
InspectMachine exercises AuthoritativeMachineState.
InspectMachine starts-when InspectMachineReady.
InspectMachine starts-at InspectMachineReceive.
InspectMachineReady describes "A configured target session has a record to inspect.".
InspectMachineContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
InspectMachineReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
InspectMachineCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
InspectMachineRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
InspectMachine preserves DomainTruthOwned.
InspectMachine preserves ConservativeQuality.
InspectMachine preserves HiddenTruthIsolated.
InspectMachineReceive calls ConsumeTargetRecord within MachineService.
InspectMachineReceive describes "Receive exact Target record and lineage.".
InspectMachineReceive proceeds-to InspectMachineFailure when InspectMachineReject.
InspectMachineReceive proceeds-to InspectMachineDecode when InspectMachineContinue.
InspectMachineDecode calls DecodeP1000Frames within MachineService.
InspectMachineDecode describes "Reject invalid/capture-unsupported frame; never split on payload FF.".
InspectMachineDecode proceeds-to InspectMachineFailure when InspectMachineReject.
InspectMachineDecode proceeds-to InspectMachineCalibrate when InspectMachineContinue.
InspectMachineCalibrate calls CalibrateMeasurement within MachineService.
InspectMachineCalibrate describes "Keep raw-only/unknown explicit if calibration is absent.".
InspectMachineCalibrate proceeds-to InspectMachineFailure when InspectMachineReject.
InspectMachineCalibrate proceeds-to InspectMachineReduce when InspectMachineContinue.
InspectMachineReduce calls ReduceMachineState within MachineService.
InspectMachineReduce describes "Apply accepted semantic evidence in authoritative order.".
InspectMachineReduce proceeds-to InspectMachineFailure when InspectMachineReject.
InspectMachineReduce proceeds-to InspectMachinePublish when InspectMachineContinue.
InspectMachinePublish calls PublishMachineBaseline within MachineService.
InspectMachinePublish describes "Publish domain state/events with recovery baseline.".
InspectMachinePublish proceeds-to InspectMachineFailure when InspectMachineReject.
InspectMachinePublish proceeds-to InspectMachineAdapt when InspectMachineContinue.
InspectMachineAdapt calls AdaptBrowserState within BuckingWeb.
InspectMachineAdapt describes "Preserve independent upstream sessions and browser state.".
InspectMachineAdapt proceeds-to InspectMachineFailure when InspectMachineReject.
InspectMachineAdapt proceeds-to InspectMachineProject when InspectMachineContinue.
InspectMachineProject calls ProjectOperatorDomain within BuckingUI.
InspectMachineProject describes "Project accepted values without taking domain ownership.".
InspectMachineProject proceeds-to InspectMachineFailure when InspectMachineReject.
InspectMachineProject proceeds-to InspectMachineSuccess when InspectMachineContinue.
InspectMachineFailure finishes InspectMachine with InspectMachineRejected.
InspectMachineSuccess finishes InspectMachine with InspectMachineCompleted.
InspectMachineReceive receives TargetResponses through TargetChannel.
InspectMachinePublish emits MachineResponses through MachineServiceUpstream.
InspectMachineAdapt receives MachineResponses through MachineServiceUpstream.
InspectMachineAdapt emits OperatorBrowserResponses through OperatorBrowserChannel.
InspectMachineProject receives OperatorBrowserResponses through OperatorBrowserChannel.
